#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:2 53e2293091374d4eac99697076531229
msgid "Agent Skills"
msgstr "智能体技能"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:4 b02cbeda0968458fbff6f1f3a7f5fed0
msgid ""
"PyBroker ships `Agent Skills <https://agentskills.io/specification>`_ "
"that give coding agents workflows for writing strategies, indicators, "
"models, and backtests."
msgstr ""
"PyBroker 内置了 `智能体技能 "
"<https://agentskills.io/specification>`_，为编程智能体提供编写策略、指标、模型和回测的工作流程。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:9 604779d710b24ee0a056bc025b74cd42
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:11 eeea357677ee41ef86a1401576036622
msgid ""
"Public skills live under the ``skills/`` directory in the PyBroker `Git "
"repository <https://github.com/edtechre/pybroker>`_. Each skill is "
"contained in its own folder and defined by a standard ``SKILL.md`` file."
msgstr ""
"公开技能位于 PyBroker `Git 仓库 <https://github.com/edtechre/pybroker>`_ 中的 "
"``skills/`` 目录下。每个技能都存放在各自的文件夹中，并由标准的 ``SKILL.md`` 文件定义。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:15 f379ee01d480478382b7887ba0fdc041
msgid ""
"The recommended way to install them is the `Skills CLI "
"<https://github.com/vercel-labs/add-skill>`_, which supports Claude Code,"
" OpenAI Codex, Cursor, and many other coding agents:"
msgstr ""
"推荐使用 `Skills CLI <https://github.com/vercel-labs/add-skill>`_ 来安装它们，该工具支持"
" Claude Code、OpenAI Codex、Cursor 以及许多其他编程智能体："

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:24 920964a3d58b4999b3185c81eec6118f
msgid ""
"The command asks which skills to install and which agents to install them"
" for, then copies each one into that agent's skills folder. Add ``--all``"
" to install every skill for every detected agent without prompting."
msgstr ""
"该命令会询问要安装哪些技能，以及为哪些智能体安装，然后将每个技能复制到相应智能体的技能文件夹中。添加 ``--all`` "
"即可为检测到的所有智能体安装全部技能，无需任何交互提示。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:30 9e0cade1f642415a8e6042f81a3b4565
msgid "Manual Install"
msgstr "手动安装"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:32 5355c1a5e9934f10bb6b7caee0e06f37
msgid ""
"You can also clone the PyBroker repository and symlink the skills "
"yourself:"
msgstr "你也可以克隆 PyBroker 仓库，自行将技能软链接过去："

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:47 913756b8a88d4fa6a8e11cbc2a4629b9
msgid "Replace ``.claude/skills`` with the folder that your own agent reads."
msgstr "请将 ``.claude/skills`` 替换为你自己的智能体所读取的文件夹。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:50 59d1b3ad0e674cc6818dbe41aec46ae2
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:52 42fd318d23da4d5881ac7f11b2541051
msgid ""
"`Claude Code <https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills>`_ discovers skills "
"placed inside a ``.claude/skills/`` folder in your project root. Once "
"they are installed, every skill and its respective commands become "
"available in the terminal."
msgstr ""
"`Claude Code <https://code.claude.com/docs/en/skills>`_ 会发现放置在项目根目录下 "
"``.claude/skills/`` 文件夹中的技能。安装完成后，每个技能及其对应的命令都将在终端中可用。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:58 59c243f6ee74462088067d42c2113fec
msgid "OpenAI Codex"
msgstr "OpenAI Codex"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:60 7f9a3527df644503865ee3fe4c871929
msgid ""
"`OpenAI Codex <https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/build-skills>`_ discovers "
"skills in ``.agents/skills/``."
msgstr ""
"`OpenAI Codex <https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/build-skills>`_ 会在 "
"``.agents/skills/`` 中发现技能。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:64 096bdbf1fe8a4b2c9d613f6c07378b92
msgid "Cursor"
msgstr "Cursor"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:66 ae648e94394b41769135d9a20aaa7ab2
msgid ""
"`Cursor <https://cursor.com/docs/skills>`_ discovers skills in "
"``.cursor/skills/``."
msgstr "`Cursor <https://cursor.com/docs/skills>`_ 会在 ``.cursor/skills/`` 中发现技能。"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:70 ce21bcf2ebff49ff917d31832d61ec0b
msgid "Claude Agent SDK"
msgstr "Claude Agent SDK"

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:72 ea30e29dc44e4f81b2986c6386a4e42e
msgid ""
"The `Claude Agent SDK <https://code.claude.com/docs/en/agent-"
"sdk/skills>`_ discovers skills from the ``.claude/skills/`` folder "
"installed above, so it loads them on demand and invokes them "
"automatically without any prompt assembly:"
msgstr ""
"`Claude Agent SDK <https://code.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/skills>`_ "
"会从上面安装的 ``.claude/skills/`` 文件夹中发现技能，因此它可以按需加载这些技能，并自动调用它们，无需任何提示词拼装："

#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:107 70fcf63157ab48b9b7b0372c96cf35a1
