#: ../../source/agent-skills.rst:137 6273292e088842c98d1ae7329ecf534f
msgid "pybroker-strategy-creator"
msgstr "pybroker-strategy-creator"

#: ../../../skills/pybroker-strategy-creator/SKILL.md:3
#: a9809655c9c14dd7bec44302f7c3cbe4
msgid ""
"Create practical PyBroker strategy code from user intent while preserving"
" backtest hygiene, including no lookahead leakage, explicit sizing, clear"
" risk controls, and locally valid PyBroker API usage."
msgstr ""
"根据用户意图生成实用的 PyBroker 策略代码，同时保持良好的回测规范，包括无前视泄漏、明确的仓位规模、清晰的风险控制，以及符合规范的 "
"PyBroker API 用法。"

